# tone_test.cmd.in -- DSPTONE end to end in MAME (run_mame.sh fills @TAP@ and @OUT@), for the remote rig
# (kn7000_mame tools/rigs/remote.lua). The card holds the program menu (root KN7APP.BIN) and DSPTONE\ only.
# A note before (the firmware's reverb), then DISK MENU > STYLE CONVERT > OK (the loader loads the menu),
# LCDL 1 (DSPTONE, the only program) and RUN; DSPTONE hooks itself in and plays the sine; CHIRP uploads the PCM
# and plays it; MUTE; STOP (puts the firmware's slot back); LEAVE; a note after (the firmware's reverb again).
wait 25
@TAP@
press KEYS1 0100 1.0
wait 5
press CPR_SEG1 04
wait 4
press CPL_SEG0 20
wait 6
press CPR_SEG6 01
wait 25
snap
press CPL_SEG0 02
wait 1
press CPR_SEG5 01
wait 12
snap
press CPR_SEG5 20
wait 10
snap
press CPR_SEG7 01
wait 3
press CPR_SEG5 01
wait 3
snap
press CPR_SEG6 01
wait 10
snap
press KEYS1 0100 1.0
wait 5
exit
